        "created_at": "2013-07-02T20:55:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unity is more of a hero with minions, though. If you had a deck of multiple heroes...if they were like the Ennead, wouldn't that mean that one of them being defeated meant you could still carry on? If Unity goes, it doesn't matter how many Bots are in play - they all disappear. If you had multiple heroes in the same deck...presumably you'd be able to carry on until they were all knocked out. Would they each have their own Incapacitated powers, then, like the Ennead?</p>",
